[tool], is, in the catalog
    if [tool], returns, [any field]
[command], is, named as a command
    if [command], calls, [any tool], [any input]
    and [command], starts with, "command: "

[command], breaks, Every command calls a tool in the catalog
    if [command], calls, [tool], [any input]
    and not [tool], is, in the catalog
[command], breaks, Every command is named as a command
    if [command], calls, [any tool], [any input]
    and not [command], is, named as a command

a command with a tool nobody has, adds line, workflow.plain, "command: guess, calls, guess, x"
a command with a tool nobody has, must break, Every command calls a tool in the catalog
a command with a tool nobody has, must answer, false

a command not named as a command, adds line, workflow.plain, "list it, calls, list, the folder"
a command not named as a command, must break, Every command is named as a command

[command], breaks, Every tool returns only what the catalog lists
    if [command], returned, [field], [any value]
    and [command], calls, [tool], [any input]
    and not [tool], returns, [field]

a command with two tools, adds line, workflow.plain, "command: a mix-up, calls, list, the folder"
a command with two tools, adds line, workflow.plain, "command: a mix-up, calls, find go comments, tools.go"
a command with two tools, must break, Every tool returns only what the catalog lists

